                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/5197: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hughes</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-03-25T18:00:00-05:00">March 25, 1937—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>40. Your 61, February 25, 4 p.m. Please comment on press reports that refugees
                    were attacked and otherwise mistreated after leaving the Legation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
